---- MODULE append ----
EXTENDS Naturals, Sequences, TLAPS
THEOREM ASSUME NEW S, NEW s \in Seq(S), NEW a \in S PROVE Len(Append(s, a)) = Len(s) + 1
  BY SMT
====

